      "rationale": "The upgrade has nested flight arguments and a payment identifier; the additional inquiry calls for user-reservation discovery beyond the listed reservation lookups.",
      "evidence": [{"citation_id": "E0140"}, {"citation_id": "E0210"}, {"citation_id": "E0007"}]
    },
    "dependencies": {
      "level": 3,
      "rationale": "Lookup and eligibility checks precede each write, explicit confirmation precedes updates, and XEHM4B must be upgraded before its business-class cancellation. The later inquiry introduces linked account records.",
